---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/layout/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service - Qiskit Fall Fest 2026">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 py-24 max-w-4xl text-text">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8 text-[#ff4d80]">Terms of Service</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none prose-headings:text-text prose-p:text-text-muted prose-a:text-primary">
      <p class="italic">Last updated: September 2026</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">By registering for and attending the Qiskit Fall Fest 2026, you agree to abide by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not register for or attend the event.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">2. Code of Conduct</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">All attendees, speakers, sponsors, and volunteers are required to agree with the code of conduct. Organizers will enforce this code throughout the event. We expect cooperation from all participants to help ensure a safe environment for everybody.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">3. Registration and Tickets</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">Registration fees are non-refundable unless otherwise specified by the organizers. Tickets are non-transferable without prior approval from the organizing team.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">4. Event Changes</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">The organizers reserve the right to make changes to the schedule, speakers, or any other aspect of the event without prior notice.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">5. Liability</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">The organizers are not liable for any personal injury, loss, or damage to property that may occur during the event.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">6. Modifications</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Your continued participation in the event constitutes your acceptance of the updated terms.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mt-12">
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-text hover:text-[#ff4d80] transition-colors font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-surface border border-border hover:border-[#ff4d80]/50">
        &larr; Back to Home
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
